# Automat environments (maintainer LAN)

Authoritative hosts for the Automat Unraid deployment. Full runbook:
[docs/ops/AUTOMAT.md](../../docs/ops/AUTOMAT.md).

## Source of truth (version / health / UI)

| Role | URL | Notes |
|------|-----|-------|
| **Librarian** | `http://10.10.1.202:8793` | Version, `/api/health`, SPA — **product port** |
| Projectionist prod | `:8788` | Sibling — **never** stop or bind Librarian here |
| Smart Map | `:8790` | Sibling — **never** stop or bind here |
| Lobby / QA Lobby | `:8791` / `:8792` | Projectionist theater — **never** bind Librarian |
| **Not truth** | any `*.automat.vip` / ad-hoc tunnels | CDN/proxy lag; agents read stale versions here |

- Product / Automat = **8793**. Mocked Playwright e2e = **8794** (see [e2e-ports.mdc](e2e-ports.mdc)).
- `localhost:8793` on a laptop may be an **SSH tunnel to Automat** — not local `python -m librarian.web`.
- Kit: `/mnt/user/appdata/librarian` (`config/` → `/config`, `/mnt/user/data` → `/data`).

## Deploy (current truth)

**Automat path now is host `./docker-run.sh` only.** There is no Hub pull-only `rollout.sh` in active use and no `docker-release.sh` for this kit yet. Hub `romwil/librarian` stays deferred. Do not invent Hub-first release scripts.

```bash
# After kit sync on Unraid:
cd /mnt/user/appdata/librarian && ./docker-run.sh
curl -s http://10.10.1.202:8793/api/health
```

## Secrets

- NZBFinder / SAB / session tokens live in `.env` or `/config/settings.json` only — **never commit**.
- The public `librarian-dev-session-secret` is **refused** by the app. Generate a real secret on the host (`openssl rand -base64 48`).
- `LIBRARIAN_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` is opt-in (default off) — set only behind a real reverse proxy, never on a laptop tunnel.

## UI verification

When the user reports UI missing/broken — especially with a screenshot — verify with **cursor-ide-browser** against `http://10.10.1.202:8793` (or local `:8793`). Trust scrolled UI + screenshots; do not argue from bundle string greps.

Interactive QA: [interactive-ui-qa skill](../skills/interactive-ui-qa/SKILL.md). Adversarial proofs: [ui-testing-architecture.mdc](ui-testing-architecture.mdc).
